# GO-2026-5932 affects only golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp and its subpackages.
# Portage Engine directly imports golang.org/x/crypto/blake2b and no OpenPGP
# package; govulncheck confirms that the vulnerable symbols are unreachable.
# The advisory affects every x/crypto version and has no patched release, so a
# version bump cannot resolve this module-level Trivy false positive.
